{"id":"vod_sn_36283","vodId":"36283","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天才麻将少女","name_cn":"天才麻将少女","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/54dfd6bf53411ad79595008aa448e16d.jpg"},"summary":"在21世纪，麻将成为了世界性的娱乐活动，各地都在举办着相关的竞技比赛，其中要以在高中生之间举办的全国麻将大赛最为权威。同时，一部分在麻将上有着杰出天赋的选手们也接连浮出水面，天才少女宫永咲（植田佳奈 配音）和原村和（小清水亚美 配音）均为其中的一份子。　　在麻将场上，原村和看重的是经验与数据，根据其丰富的对战经历为对手分门别类从而取得优势。宫永咲则有着完全不同的技巧，无论遇上怎样的牌局，均能够以不胜不服的成绩结束比赛。一次对决之后，不打不相识的两人决定加入学校的麻将部，战胜道路上不断涌现的敌人，最终称霸全国大赛。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5UEaYCreBT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dKWsXGamUN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XSxcGyU9rK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XP2cvqS1fb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1Q2gGTENNJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PRqCkLAaFf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UnRBfUV3eb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6zxbtjc3sE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uAC1CHSQgj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ls9ALiP2Kj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P0crYm46YV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tmnFjNnYeL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bRJQgk4bsD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WHnsGsZLbn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.